      "message": "fix(drilling): preserve opposite blind hole depths and mouths\n\nMerge coaxial walls only when their axial spans touch or overlap.\nUse floor evidence to keep each blind hole's entry direction.\nReport directed findings on mills and retain generation refusals.\nPin closed opposite holes and a six-hole D50 bar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\nFixes #2601",
